<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>方法总览：每来一个关键帧做六件事</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>06 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>设计哲学一句话：<b>每帧做小事，偶尔做一次大事</b>。前者保证实时，后者保证不漂。每一步都对应上一页四个问题中的一个。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '18px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 1</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>两级匹配</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>检索候选 → 局部特征 → 精验，得到可信帧对</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>治"乱"</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 2</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>更新协视图</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>边权 = 内点数倒数，越可靠越"近"</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>为后续提供"距离"</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 3</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>回环检测</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>簇间跳数 &gt; 5 且有效对 &gt; 2 才触发</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>治"漂"·发现</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 4</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>局部 BA</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>选 20 个高连通帧，GPU 上优化位姿</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>治"慢"</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 5</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>回环修正</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>焊接 BA + 主干传播，位姿与高斯一起动</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>治"漂"·修正</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: '158px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '16px 14px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>STEP 6</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', marginTop: 7 }}>投放与优化</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 7 }}>分块深度对齐投放，每帧固定 30 次迭代</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1D5FC0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 'auto' }}>治"爆"（配层级）</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '18px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '15px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>另有一处容错：匹配失败的帧先"搁置"，后续出现相似帧时再取出重试——乱序输入因此不必强求一次匹配成功。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8B97A8' }}>六步中只有 STEP 3 与 STEP 5 是"偶尔做一次的大事"，其余每帧都跑；这也是实时性的来源。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
